したいので縦長サイズでお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@gFfewuoUtGblUBh/works/66", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3ac46e61/uploads/origins/80990d3e-74e9-4ef8-89c1-a12842466786?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=461ec84ef862b1c79fc3bb4cc3506bda", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3ac46e61/uploads/origins/80990d3e-74e9-4ef8-89c1-a12842466786?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=461ec84ef862b1c79fc3bb4cc3506bda, https://si.imgix.net/3ac46e61/uploads/origins/80990d3e-74e9-4ef8-89c1-a12842466786?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b0d2bfd4d2577e5a8efa148a8c51cf5a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3ac46e61/uploads/origins/80990d3e-74e9-4ef8-89c1-a12842466786?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ceeea61159f7b1ef0c39fcde0452d77b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はるゆきさんの描くヤマノススメの倉上ひなた(https://yamanosusume-ns.com/chara/02.html)が見たいです！\n登山時の格好(外側イエローで内側オレンジのジャケット, HPのトップでしている格好 https://yamanosusume-ns.com/)だとうれしいです。\nポーズ等はおまかせします。\n\n用途はSNSアイコン、個人鑑賞です。ご検討よろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://yamanosusume-ns.com/", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@gFfewuoUtGblUBh/works/65", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7a2a2fda/uploads/origins/21a9e576-7861-4649-8974-699faeb9d34b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4470c7c6062001e36d10f4cc3448dd15", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7a2a2fda/uploads/origins/21a9e576-7861-4649-8974-699faeb9d34b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4470c7c6062001e36d10f4cc3448dd15, https://si.imgix.net/7a2a2fda/uploads/origins/21a9e576-7861-4649-8974-699faeb9d34b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=52901c4c7a3455858d3d181fc6ac3834 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7a2a2fda/uploads/origins/21a9e576-7861-4649-8974-699faeb9d34b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2